                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5dcb65d4-ca2f-3b3f-aec8-529b0a1b5b51",
                        "entry_id": "0c95cee0-2086-39fb-9f8c-a90e8d9b6f88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Money, materials, tools, food etc. provided to a prospector in return for a share in future profits."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72e30aa5-e5eb-40f8-bd6d-c2fcddf35c04",
                                "sense_id": "5dcb65d4-ca2f-3b3f-aec8-529b0a1b5b51",
                                "text": "I've been through hell. The other three are all at work and healthy, getting grub-stake to prospect up White River this winter."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f839cb9f-b2fe-371c-9fa0-605a75a54b03",
                        "entry_id": "0c95cee0-2086-39fb-9f8c-a90e8d9b6f88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An amount of money advanced to someone starting a business in return for a share of the future profits."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "51e435cf-c82f-39fe-be16-ad5b75df9825",
                        "entry_id": "0c95cee0-2086-39fb-9f8c-a90e8d9b6f88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Money, necessities stockpiled to sustain an effort for a period of time."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "49431ca1-144b-4132-a9df-41a4a86e5501",
                                "sense_id": "51e435cf-c82f-39fe-be16-ad5b75df9825",
                                "text": "No one however should go to this country intending to mine without taking with him a year's supplies commonly known as a grub stake or its money equivalent about $1,000."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f361be0d-2a1b-4855-96ac-0489b8a30202",
                                "sense_id": "51e435cf-c82f-39fe-be16-ad5b75df9825",
                                "text": "However, each of these words might, on occasion, be used in a different sense, [...], \"grub-stake\" to denote one's food supply, regardless of how obtained."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d52cf33-e7d8-4ba0-bac3-82b64ac1a8c8",
                                "sense_id": "51e435cf-c82f-39fe-be16-ad5b75df9825",
                                "text": "The resulting income, the firm hopes, will provide it with the grubstake it needs to move on to the big prize: titanium."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
